#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Values and bindings

    # Values and bindings

    A binding gives a value a name. Unlike languages that copy small values and
    reference larger ones through different rules, Moth shares every existing
    value by default.

    Mutation needs an explicit mutable binding and exclusive access. Use `copy`
    only when you need an independent value. The same rules apply to every type.
]

